% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. An SK classroom trial, an early-years music teacher, a shakuhachi-informed educator and a second score reader must check that the four-bar answer fits one SK breath at quarter = 72, the partner turn-taking, and the listening language around honkyoku. The listening reference was changed from "Dai Bosatsu", which could not be found in any Riley Lee discography, to his "Tōri" on his official channel; the reviewer should confirm that choice.
